text.en:
The toggle lives inside the `rising_edge` branch:

```vhdl
elsif rising_edge(clk) then
    if t = '1' then
        qi <= not qi;
    end if;
end if;
```

text.es:
La conmutación vive dentro de la rama `rising_edge`:

```vhdl
elsif rising_edge(clk) then
    if t = '1' then
        qi <= not qi;
    end if;
end if;
```
